## Red team

A competing product can argue that unique headings still hide a shared fake screen. The revision therefore binds each route to a provider family, tab count, account state, capability boundary, primary action and next owner. Unsupported destinations are explicit disabled or external-guide screens, not generic queue replicas. The controller then found that the responsive simulator passed while the actual 390 media query lacked drawer rules. The retake now shares the complete mobile layout behavior with the real media query and verifies the body with no simulator class.

## Self-question

If this conclusion is wrong, the most likely reason is that customers skip weekly planning and open Studio directly. The design keeps direct Studio entry unchanged and treats Marketing Agent guidance as additive. It does not gate current workflows behind the new loop.

